GPT-QModel Ouro Transformers 5 port

Adapted from ByteDance's Ouro-1.4B, Ouro-2.6B, Ouro-1.4B-Thinking and
Ouro-2.6B-Thinking configuration/modeling sources. Exact Hugging Face repository
revisions and source SHA-256 hashes are recorded in source_manifest.json.
The upstream model cards declare Apache-2.0; configuration_ouro.py includes
the Apache-2.0 notice reproduced in the port's source header and LICENSE.
The checkpoint repositories inspected do not contain a standalone LICENSE file;
LICENSE reproduces the canonical Apache License, Version 2.0 text.

